			"notes": "Fixes a crash when retroauth is used alongside glass-networking.\n\nBoth mods widen the 32-character handshake string-length cap via a `@ModifyConstant` on `HandshakePacket.read`. Only one injector can rewrite that constant, so when glass-networking's applied first, retroauth's injector found 0 targets and turned that into a fatal `InjectionError` — aborting `HandshakePacket` transformation and crashing on startup (surfacing as an `osl-networking-impl` init failure).\n\nretroauth's injection is now optional (`require = 0`): it applies the widening when used alone and cleanly no-ops when glass-networking already did it."
		},
