			"notes": "RetroAuth 1.3.0\n\n- Rebuilt for Ornithe gen2 (ORNITHE_V2). Fixes the \"Failed to verify username!\"\n  login failure that happened on the current toolchain (the auth mixin no longer\n  silently fails to apply, so modern Mojang authentication actually runs).\n- Now ships a Babric build alongside the Ornithe build, with OSL (incl.\n  networking) bundled so it's self-contained on the Babric platform.\n- Modern Mojang session authentication (session server hasJoined/join) on b1.7.3.\n- Widened the handshake string limit so longer auth payloads no longer trip\n  \"Received string length longer than maximum allowed\".\n- Plays nicely with starac / RetroCenter on the same connection.\n\nInstall the Ornithe jar on Ornithe, or the -babric jar on Babric."
		},
